WEBVTT

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:13.740
Again, the Bruno team of teenagers with attitudes.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:23.560
Trini, I am going to have so much fun today.

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:26.260
My uncle Steve is taking me out flying.

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:28.870
Oh, Trini, hold on a sec.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:29.840
Are you ready?

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.900
I'm just going to pick up some maps and we'll be ready to take off.

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:33.200
Okay, I'll meet you right here.

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:33.660
All righty.

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:35.220
Hello?

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:46.960
Aw, man.

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:49.330
Aw, man, there she is.

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:49.850
Who?

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:51.180
Angel.

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:55.180
Oh, my dream.

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:57.270
Does she even know you're alive?

00:01:58.750 --> 00:01:59.610
She will in a minute.

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:02.030
Watch, learn.

00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:10.750
Yo, Angie, so, uh, you got any time for the Zagman?

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:11.980
Get real.

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:17.950
Oh, Kimberly's going flying.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:20.950
Well, what goes up, we can push down, eh?

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:23.830
With a sleeping potion for Pilot Steve.

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:24.470
Regal.

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:26.320
Then you send down desert.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:26.960
Yay.

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:28.350
Yeah.

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:29.920
What?

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:46.100
This'll put that pilot to sleep.

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:48.620
Just pouring it makes me want to take a nap.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.840
You know, Skull, I always wanted to be a pilot.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:11.890
Fly up in the sky, looking down at the world.

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:13.010
Yeah, me too.

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:17.020
You know, I've got the mind of a pilot.

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:19.890
Oh, yeah? What makes you think that?

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:23.190
Mr. Kaplan says I'm an airhead.

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:29.230
Hey, Skull, look at that. It's right over there.

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:36.340
And then we'll go north.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:39.390
Fly right between the mountains.

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:44.800
Where are you going?

00:03:45.650 --> 00:03:46.770
Flying with my uncle.

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:48.640
Well, it was nice to see you guys.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:52.150
Hey, wait! Flying with you?

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:54.640
Yeah! Can we go flying?

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:55.250
No.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.970
Well, look, it's a really small...

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:05.120
plan and I don't think um maybe some other time your friends are welcome to

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:13.990
go with us but hey thanks uncle yeah uncle why don't you guys just call me

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:14.270
Steve

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:59.980
3024 ECHO requesting permission to take over.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:05.040
Roger, 3-0-2-4-Echo, you are clear for takeoff on runway 1-2.

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:05.960
Roger.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:20.090
Yeah, I know.

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:21.110
I know.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:22.250
I know.

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:23.230
We're way on the road!

00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:23.710
I know!

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:25.320
Oh!

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:31.590
Are you afraid of flying?

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:36.400
Nah, I'm afraid of crashing.

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:45.530
Sit back, you're rocking the plane.

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:47.840
Oh, a rebook.

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:56.970
Wow, Angel Grove looks so beautiful from up here.

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:00.770
Look, the park.

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:04.610
Will you move so I can see the park?

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:07.870
Guys, look down there.

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:08.650
There's the use center.

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:12.040
They're in the air.

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:14.180
The pilot should be out of commission soon

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.600
unless you've messed up again.

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:17.460
I put the potion in just like you said.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:18.540
I did, I did.

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:20.660
Come, it's time.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.730
Oh, boy, it's time to bring out the new monster.

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:25.750
We're going to send down the Snizzard.

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:27.700
Half snake, half lizard.

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:29.980
The Snizzard attacks by releasing its...

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:32.530
slaying cobras or by firing them in arrows.

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:36.290
When they hit, they'll drain the energy out of the Power Rangers.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:41.700
These mountains are so awesome.

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:45.110
Yeah, those mountains are awesome.

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:48.080
Kimberly, is this the first time you've flown over these mountains?

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:49.060
No.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:52.400
Well, I've flown by here before.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.380
A lot of memories of these mountains.

00:06:58.640 --> 00:06:59.960
He chose us to save the world.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.020
I say we do it.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:03.360
Do you really think we can?

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:35.100
Uncle Steve? What's wrong?

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:38.710
Oh, I'm just feeling kind of dizzy.

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:40.100
What did he say?

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:43.420
Nothing. He's just feeling a little dizzy.

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:00.620
He's fain!

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:15.900
Stop!

00:08:58.570 --> 00:08:58.830
I'm just...

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:04.570
He's just unconscious. Nothing to worry about.

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:07.190
I think now's a good time for me to faint.

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.220
Yeah, good idea.

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:41.030
Alpha, the scanner is showing Kimberly at an altitude of 5,000 feet and dropping.

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:42.780
Keep trying to locate her.

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:43.860
Oh, Alpha!

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:59.570
If your life is in danger, just morph out of there!

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:01.440
Yucky!

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:16.490
People in-

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:19.370
Alert the rest of the Power Rangers! Rita has begun a new attack!

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:23.150
Ay-yay-yay-yay! Must mean she has a new monster!

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:29.970
I've signaled the Power Rangers! What a ter-

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.860
It's a terrible time for Rita to decide to attack.

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:33.460
It is no coincidence.

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:36.220
This is part of Rita's plan to divert our attention

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:38.840
while her monster begins its attack on Angel Grove.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.240
Teleport the other Power Rangers here immediately.

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:44.320
Right, Zordon. They're on their way.

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:46.630
Kimberly, can you hear me?

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:49.370
I will instruct you how to land the plane.

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.420
Hold it as steady as you can,

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:54.260
then slowly pull the controls back towards you.

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:55.080
King!

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:03.060
There is no need to panic yet, Power Rangers.

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:08.460
Kimberly is a very bright and capable girl, and the aircraft is no longer losing altitude.

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:10.500
Aye, aye, aye, aye, aye.

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:12.640
She doesn't have much of it left to lose.

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:17.750
We must help Kimberly to gain control of the plane and turn it around.

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:20.800
Her fuel supply is running dangerously low.

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:24.840
Dang, check it out.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:27.760
Oh no, the plane's heading right for the mountains.

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:32.860
Second stage alert!

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:34.300
That is why I summoned you.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:35.040
What now?

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:38.160
Rita's latest monster is wreaking havoc in Angel Grove Park.

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:39.260
We gotta go.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:40.070
Now.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:41.660
Alpha, take care of Kimberly.

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:42.760
I will!

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:44.880
Just be careful fighting the snizzard!

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:46.340
It's morphin' time, guys.

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:48.260
Thron!

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:49.540
Triceratops!

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:50.640
Sabretoon Tiger!

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:51.680
Tyrannosaurus!

00:12:11.836 --> 00:12:13.836
me

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:39.870
Kimberly, turn the wheel gently so the plane banks at 20 degrees.

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:44.370
It will take you about 40 seconds to complete a 180-degree turn.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:46.020
Stay home.

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:57.210
Eh, schnizzle skin!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.190
We need Kimberly!

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:02.590
Aye, aye, aye, aye, aye!

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:04.410
Alpha, don't say that!

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:05.240
You're scaring me!

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:06.260
I'm sorry, Kimberly.

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:08.420
I was referring to the other rangers.

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:10.600
They're engaged in a battle with Rita's monster,

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:12.020
and they need your help.

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:13.540
They're not doing very well.

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:14.980
You must land the plane...

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:20.760
soon as possible. What about my uncle? We've sent a message to Angel Grove Airport. There'll be an

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:28.900
ambulance waiting for you when you land. Alpha, I can see Angel Grove. Hold on, Kimberly. I'll check back with you soon.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:38.300
It's about to hardly move.

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:41.740
Feel my cobra straining your energy, foolish Power Rangers.

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:42.860
He's running.

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:45.140
I'm getting weaker.

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:15.610
Kimberly's flying the plane

00:14:30.156 --> 00:14:33.616
It looks like the Snizzard has Jason and the others all wrapped up.

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:37.340
Alpha, the Rangers need Kimberly's power bow to defeat this monster.

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:39.940
Concentrate on helping her to a safe landing!

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:41.040
Yes, Zordon!

00:14:41.164 --> 00:14:43.444
Oh, why couldn't I have been built with four arms?

00:14:43.664 --> 00:14:44.584
Do you read me, Kimberly?

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:45.800
Yes, Alpha.

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:46.580
How are you doing?

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:47.820
I think I can see the airport.

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:48.700
Good, Kimberly.

00:14:49.020 --> 00:14:52.740
Now remember, you must approach the runway at the proper air speed.

00:14:53.196 --> 00:14:56.356
Reduce your speed by adjusting the knob marked throttle.

00:14:56.876 --> 00:14:59.996
Now begin your descent by slowly pushing forward on the-

00:15:00.252 --> 00:15:00.752
Hello!

00:15:01.148 --> 00:15:01.648
Oh, Alpha!

00:15:02.588 --> 00:15:03.588
I hope I can do this.

00:15:05.628 --> 00:15:08.628
You can do anything you set your mind to, Kimberly.

00:15:09.116 --> 00:15:09.956
You're right.

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:11.980
I can do this.

00:15:13.084 --> 00:15:13.924
Look at this.

00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:15.600
Yes, I can do this.

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:21.660
3-0-2-4, I go.

00:15:21.728 --> 00:15:26.088
You are not clear to land. Repeat. You are not clear to land on this runway. Please acknowledge.

00:15:29.372 --> 00:15:29.972
3-0-2.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:33.000
State your emergency, state your emergency.

00:15:33.388 --> 00:15:34.028
3, over.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:05.880
What's going on?

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:12.380
We got it.

00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:17.970
Rescue 1, do you have radio contact with 2-4 Echo?

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:19.910
That's negative, Tower. How about you, Chuck?

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:22.840
That's negative, but Aircraft is down and under control.

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:29.970
Well, 2-4 Echo, when you get around to it...

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.790
We in the tower show would like to talk to you about that landing.

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:35.270
Do you want a tower?

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:37.190
Be advised, paramedic unit is en route.

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:38.030
Please stand by.

00:16:38.190 --> 00:16:38.370
Over.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:48.930
Oh, um, make sure our passengers are OK.

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:49.910
I got to run.

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:51.040
Call you later.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:52.120
Kimberly, wait.

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:53.120
I'll call you later.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:34.540
Bye.

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:02.790
Cheers!

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:52.460
Feeling any better

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:15.450
Oh, Mina, you're really great.

00:19:15.990 --> 00:19:18.290
Not just anybody could have landed a plane like you did.

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:20.120
You don't mean it.

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:22.260
Anyone could have done it.

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:25.360
Oh, man, you don't really mean that, do you?

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:29.310
Tell me more, you big strong hunk from Man U.

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:31.760
No pit!
